# kvkk's own scan ignores itself, and it should say why.
#
# Everything below contains identifiers that pass their check digits but belong
# to nobody: published documentation examples (the 4111… Visa test card, the
# TR33… IBAN from the ISO 13616 spec) and the fixtures the test suite needs in
# order to prove detection works at all.
#
# This file is exactly the mechanism the README recommends to everyone else,
# used on the tool itself. Run `kvkk scan . --no-ignore-file` to see through it.

tests
README.md
.github

# The library demonstrates detection in its own docstrings, and those doctests
# are executed by the test suite — the examples have to stay real.
src/kvkk
